    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Malaykajeega mideawa sawanadeeda huuydean",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghaadaayi gwadeagooda nuut aba humng'eeda, nea aahaw ak daamdaamwaat, malaykaji ispwa mideawa sawanaduut ispwa was gea huuydean, aba gideaba aba badaydeaba suh niduulean nyarasta ASEETA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.15.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghaadaayi giduurji basooda giyo guuyi beasta, ak fugiga joar diyeayda ea gissiratiidean ea mooneeda gheawungaaschi, nea ghamiinaada aba murdeeda basoodida bea giyoohiin, nea gwandeawa gidoondoorajeega ASEETA aba geatinga nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwasarman duumda Musa, was soomjeanda ASEETA, ea duumda Dayeenda Gisilleanda, nea geeyi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.15.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ng'asheesu ghaang'weardi ak ghaadaayi gheeda sibata ASEETA bea maheemajeanda bea muuwuunooda mida humng'eeda nea nijaada, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gwarina jeeda gheeda sibata ASEETA malaykaji ispwa nea gwandeawa sawanaduut ispwa, nea gookwa hang'weaka miyaasiin meeng'meeng'i, nea daghanuunatka nyaawa ea sirat aba ghealooda meeng'meeng'i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gageanu akaleala aba jeedeaba diyeangiga asang'wan majeekcheewiin ak ghoadaw malaykajeegiga asispwaan gweeraji ispwa sisna dahaabu nea ghwanyiit nyarasta ASEETA majeek ea ghoah damanda manda muudeanooda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ng'ata geanyiit gheeda sibata ASEETA aroosta leabu heeda giigheambiita ASEETA ea dea leabu uurdaanyi, ak ea manda eara siyagi ammu gawa jeeda gheeda sibata ASEETA ea eaghus ghwahit sawanaduutkiga asispwa bea malaykajeegiga asispwaan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.15.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
